# Build context for docker/render-worker.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The install runs inside the image, so nothing installed or derived on the host is copied.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/.nitro
**/.vercel
.turboslide
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
apps/studio/src/routeTree.gen.ts
.env
**/*.local
# The Rust crate's build output (docs/native.md; gitignored, 588 MB) and the documents with their
# evidence pictures (409 MB): nothing in the image reads either, and together they were a gigabyte
# of the context (the features round, ship one, check step 25).
crates/*/target
docs
